# shellcheck shell=bash
# .envrc - direnv entrypoint: put kit/bin on PATH, then hydrate .kit/ (sourced by direnv)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# direnv runs this on cd. A desk that uses direnv gets what mise.toml's [env] and enter hook give a shell with
# `mise activate`: kit/bin on PATH, and what the kit places under .kit/ in place, quietly when it already is.
#
# mise's tools come from mise itself. mise has deprecated `use mise`, its direnv integration.

PATH_add kit/bin
kit hydrate --quick

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
